---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const cat = 'Jobs';
---

<BaseLayout title="Remote Project Management Jobs 2026: Complete Guide to Landing a Work-From-Home PM Career | RemoteWorkHub" description="Complete guide to remote project management jobs in 2026. Top companies hiring remote PMs, salary ranges by specialization from $42K-$180K+, essential certifications (PMP, CAPM, CSM, PRINCE2, PMI-ACP), PM tools stack across 10 categories, and how to break into remote project management with or without experience. Includes project coordinator, Scrum Master, TPM, program manager, PMO director, and product manager career paths.">
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 py-8">
    <header class="mb-8">
      <p class="text-sm text-brand-500 font-medium mb-2">{cat}</p>
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Remote Project Management Jobs 2026: Complete Guide to Landing a Work-From-Home PM Career | RemoteWorkHub</h1>
      <time class="text-sm text-gray-500">2026</time>
      
      <div class="mt-3 flex gap-2 flex-wrap">
        <span class="text-xs bg-gray-700 text-gray-300 px-2 py-1 rounded">jobs</span>
        <span class="text-xs bg-gray-700 text-gray-300 px-2 py-1 rounded">project-management</span>
        <span class="text-xs bg-gray-700 text-gray-300 px-2 py-1 rounded">pm</span>
        <span class="text-xs bg-gray-700 text-gray-300 px-2 py-1 rounded">career</span>
        <span class="text-xs bg-gray-700 text-gray-300 px-2 py-1 rounded">entry-level</span>
        <span class="text-xs bg-gray-700 text-gray-300 px-2 py-1 rounded">agile</span>
        <span class="text-xs bg-gray-700 text-gray-300 px-2 py-1 rounded">scrum</span>
      </div>
    </header>
    <div class="prose prose-invert prose-gray max-w-none">
      <p>Complete guide to remote project management jobs in 2026. Top companies hiring remote PMs, salary ranges by specialization from $42K-$180K+, essential certifications (PMP, CAPM, CSM, PRINCE2, PMI-ACP), PM tools stack across 10 categories, and how to break into remote project management with or without experience. Includes project coordinator, Scrum Master, TPM, program manager, PMO director, and product manager career paths.</p>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
